      ],
      "source": "https://newhopetx.gov/about",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "New Hope sits just three miles east of McKinney, placing it comfortably within Collin County’s suburban spread.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
